<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">FLM - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">FILEMƆ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan akà Filɛmɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">FILEMƆ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemɔ</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Filemɔ wà un'kaan kàn'söönà ikɔ̈kɔ̈ unsà in'kaan myanswà kàsöön Pɔl baar. Nde kàtöm wa sye akà Apyà, bàfàsi naa nde wà un'kyay a Filemɔ, akà un'tɔŋ abi Arship, anà akà Ikööŋ ifàköŋ u ndwà a Filemɔ. Aŋan'yeerà bàfàsi naa Pɔl un'kaan awà kàsön u mbul an'kwem an'syaam aŋisyaam ungö ukwà a Yɛsu Klistɔ, umpal kàkäl nde u bɔlokà u Lɔmà.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isin kàsön Pɔl un'kaan awà akà Filɛmɔ kyàkäl mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ a Ɔnɛsim, mwan ande unsà dweelà. Ɔnɛsim wà un'sɔ a Filɛmɔ awà kun'tiin. Pɔl kun'swɛŋ mbwo umpal kàkäl nde u bɔlokà ntɔn nde kàsi làkwikilà amu Yɛsu Klistɔ. Pɔl kàkwen naa Ɔnɛsim ufurà akà Filɛmɔ asànaa un'klistɔ anà mbuur aŋàsɔɔmà. Mfuurà ande kwo yun'twääl ntaaŋàmbar. Mbuul a ikɔb Ɔnɛsim yà naa « mfun ». Ikaswaŋà naa kusà Ɔnɛsim kàkäl anki mfun akà Filemɔ, wɛɛ apanà nde kan'bulà mfun. Pɔl we anà ukwen mbɔɔn ntɔn Ɔnɛsim anà we anà làzir sye akà Filemɔ. Pɔl ukasɔnà kan'kɔɔ ande ŋàkwo naa nde we anà ukwen mufurà akà Filemɔ, undiir wanswà kàkɔ̈ɔ̈n awal nde ntɔn an'yilà a Ɔnɛsim. Wɛɛ Pɔl akayɔɔbà Filɛmɔ sye naa mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ŋàkwo wà nkul ufuur nde akà nde. Pɔl kan'sà làkyän naa Filemɔ ayàpà nkul a ifà imwɛy. Un'kaan awà wàŋàyilà abà:</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.1-3: Nsɛmà a un'kaan anà mbɔr</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.4-7: An'tɔɔn anà ngyamàkà</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.8-22: Pɔl an'bɔɔn Filemɔ ntɔn Ɔnɛsim</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.8-22: Mbɔr a ntsüü anà nsaak.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Pɔl, mbuur a bɔlokà ntɔn Yɛsu Klistɔ anà un'tɔŋ abi Tumàtɛ, bi ban'pà mbɔr akà ngye Filemɔ, nkween abi anà un'baay abi, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>anà akà un'tɔŋ abi wà un'kaar Apyà, anà akà Arship awà afànwaan ità imwɛy anà bi, anà akà un'tüüb awà afàköŋ u ndwà angye. <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Wɛy Taaràbi Nzam anà Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ bàlapɛ kab a ngway anà duu!<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwen anà làkwikilà a Filemɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Filemɔ, mɛ in'fàpà an'tɔɔn akà Nzam amɛ taaŋ lanswà, anà in'fatà din u ngyamàkà amɛ, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>ntɔn mɛ in'fàwem làsaŋ a làkwikilà angye akà Mwol Yɛsu anà ukwen angye akà aŋin'kyɛɛl banswà. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Mɛ kàlɔ̈m akà Nzam naa làkwikilà làbà bi un'tüüb, ngye anà mɛ, làkäl ngwal amu ngye, ntɔn la làswɛŋ ubwaŋàbwaŋ ubwaŋ banswà ibà bi abà ntɔn Klistɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Un'tɔŋ, mɛ kàmɛn un'sak anà ngwal mbɔɔn, ntɔn, u mbwo a ukwen angye, ngye kàkwaam mpem a aŋin'kyɛɛl.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɔl kan'sà ndɔ̈ɔ̈m ntɔn Ɔnɛsim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Lalan, itàkal naa mɛ in'wà nsaay amu Klistɔ mukaswaŋ buur angye, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>wɛɛ mɛ in'kwen mukasà ndɔ̈ɔ̈m yi kà ikↄb a ukwen. Inye, mɛ Pɔl, in'wà un'nün anà in'wà apanà u bɔlokà ntɔn Yɛsu Klistɔ, <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>mɛ amalɔn ntɔn Ɔnɛsim, awà kàbulà mwan amɛ unsà dweelà apà u bɔlokà. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Kusà, nde kàkäl anki ndöŋ akà ngye, wɛɛ apanà nde wà ndöŋ akà bi, akà ngye asànaa akà mɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Mɛ amafuur awà, nde wà asànaa mpem amɛ ŋakwo. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Mɛ in'làkwen mukun'kaar tsütsü apà mɛ ntɔn nde kan'syääl kà ikal angye umpal in'wà mɛ u bɔlokà ntɔn Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Wɛɛ mɛ inkwen anki mukyer abun ukɔɔn ukwen angye, ntɔn ngye akɔ̈ɔ̈n akyer ubwaŋ a ngwal, wɛɛ unsà mpem aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="PHM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Taaŋ lumwɛy nkaabà angye anà Ɔnɛsim u kitaaŋ yàkäl mbwo ngye mukal ipepey anà nde. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Ntɔn apanà nde kà afàkal un'sɔ mpɛl a mpɛl anki, wɛɛ nde kan'söön un'sɔ: nde wà un'tɔŋ a nkween. Nde wà ndöŋ mbɔɔn akà mɛ, wɛɛ nde kan'söön sye ndöŋ mbɔɔn akà ngye, asànaa mbuur, asànaa un'tɔŋ angye amu Klistɔ! <verse eid="PHM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Abun, isàkal naa ngye afan'wal asànaa un'tɔŋ angye unsà làkwikilà, un'wɛl sye asànaa alan'wal ngye. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Isàkal naa nde ibii kà nà kakyer, itàkal naa nde we anà nkul angye, wɔm ya yanswà udu un'tswe amɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Mɛ, Pɔl, an'sɔn kà an'kɔɔ amɛ ŋàkwo, mɛ in'kyer asafuur ya. Ndöŋ yatɛy akà mɛ mukayɔɔb naa ngye sye, ngye awe anà nkul amɛ, nkul ya mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye ŋàkwo! <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Inye, un'tɔŋ, nkyeer ubwaŋ aban ntɔn Mwol: kwaam mpem amɛ ntɔn ukwen a Klistɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Yà ntɔn unkyeey angye waa mɛ amasöön: mɛ in'kyàyöb naa ngye ayàkyer byàŋàsöön indiir amalɔ̈ɔ̈m mɛ bi. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Apanà sye, ndɔ̈ɔ̈n ikal abɔ̈ɔ̈n: mɛ an'sà làkyän naa, ntɔn ngyamàkà abɛ, itaan a mbɔɔn tɛy, bàyan'fuur ba akà bɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Ɛpafras, un'tɔŋ awà u bɔlokà anà mɛ ntɔn Yɛsu Klistɔ, kàmapà mbɔr. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Atɔŋ bàfàsal anà mɛ bàmapà mbɔr sye: Malakɔ, Aristark, Damas anà Lukà. <verse eid="PHM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Wɛy kab a ngwal a Mwol Yɛsu Klistɔ làkäl anà bɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
